# Every PR adds a bullet under `## [Unreleased]`, so two PRs touching the same
# section is the normal case here rather than a disagreement. Take both sides
# instead of stopping the merge. A release cut already folds `[Unreleased]`
# into the version section (#1189 did it for 1.27.0-1.29.0), which is where a
# duplicated `### Fixed` heading gets tidied.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
